from pathlib import Path
import subprocess,os,signal
repo=Path('/Users/steventran/jobpipe')
expected={'adapters/protocol.py','do-again.toml','do-again-policy.json','jobctl.py','tests/test_jobctl.py'}
s=subprocess.run(['git','status','--short'],cwd=repo,capture_output=True,text=True,check=True).stdout
print('INITIAL_STATUS',s)
if any(line[3:] not in expected for line in s.splitlines()): raise SystemExit('UNEXPECTED_DIRTY_FILES')
head=subprocess.run(['git','rev-parse','HEAD'],cwd=repo,capture_output=True,text=True,check=True).stdout.strip()
if head!='56a4a6bdb129e99ef765f15e5816a474b7d19fc1': raise SystemExit('HEAD_MOVED')
for file in ('jobctl.py','tests/test_jobctl.py'):
 if not any(line[3:]==file for line in s.splitlines()): raise SystemExit('EXPECTED_CHANGE_MISSING '+file)
cmd=[str(repo/'.venv/bin/python'),'-m','pytest','-q','--maxfail=1']
p=subprocess.Popen(cmd,cwd=repo,stdout=subprocess.PIPE,stderr=subprocess.PIPE,text=True,start_new_session=True)
try: out,err=p.communicate(timeout=420)
except subprocess.TimeoutExpired:
 os.killpg(p.pid,signal.SIGTERM)
 try: out,err=p.communicate(timeout=8)
 except subprocess.TimeoutExpired:
  os.killpg(p.pid,signal.SIGKILL)
  out,err=p.communicate()
 print('FULL_SUITE_TIMEOUT',out[-4200:],err[-1000:])
 raise SystemExit(124)
print('FULL_EXIT',p.returncode)
print(out[-7000:])
print(err[-1000:])
if p.returncode: raise SystemExit(p.returncode)
subprocess.run(['git','add','--','jobctl.py','tests/test_jobctl.py'],cwd=repo,check=True)
subprocess.run(['git','commit','-m','fix: exclude unresolved user blockers from default apply queue'],cwd=repo,check=True)
subprocess.run(['git','push','origin','main'],cwd=repo,check=True,timeout=90)
print('VERIFIED_PUSH')
